<td style="text-align: center;"><strong>Brief Summary of Contents</strong></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>17111992.mp3</td>
<td>Audio file of man and woman singing “Happy Birthday.” The subject of the song is heard as being “Ian.”</td>
</tr>
